OL,3,AApple unsure when more foldable iPhones
OL,4,Awill be available after selling out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new head of Apple says the company
OL,7,Fis working to get its new foldable
OL,8,FiPhones available to more people after
OL,9,Fthe $1,999 smartphone quickly sold out
OL,10,Fwhen it was released just over a week
OL,11,Fago.
OL,13,FJohn Ternus, who in September took over
OL,14,Fthe role as Apple's chief executive
OL,15,Ffrom Tim Cook, said on Monday that he
OL,16,Fwas "thrilled" at the early reaction to
OL,17,Fthe iPhone Duo.
OL,19,FWhile the costly phone, which sells for
OL,20,F#1,999 in the UK, immediately sold out,
OL,21,Fsome buyers have seen their screens
OL,22,Fcrack.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
